{"4816210":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Neon Blackfall","steam_appid":4816210,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SURVIVE THE BLACKOUT<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Blackfall is a fast-paced deckbuilding card game set in Neurovale, a city divided between two eras. The Neon Era represents life before the blackout. Blackfall begins when the lights go out and survival becomes the only law.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, choose your faction, and fight for the future of the city.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/00f52c90b7345631bf53eaa7edeaacdf.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/00f52c90b7345631bf53eaa7edeaacdf.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=872 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>TWO ERAS, ONE BATTLE<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match evolves as the game progresses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Neon Era represents the city before the catastrophe. Blackfall represents the collapse that followed. Many cards gain different abilities depending on the current era, encouraging players to build decks designed to dominate the early game, survive the darkness, or thrive in both.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/c58e5d73006b130c1b6f9fd0156f01a7.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/c58e5d73006b130c1b6f9fd0156f01a7.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=872 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>PROGRESS OR SABOTAGE<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory can be achieved in different ways.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Wisdom of your creatures to develop your base and earn Progress Points. Use Attack to eliminate enemy cards and sabotage rival bases.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you invest in your own future or destroy that of your enemies? In Neurovale, both paths can lead to victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/5564d3ea25e3ada206503c2fe58754a4.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/5564d3ea25e3ada206503c2fe58754a4.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=874 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FOUR RIVAL FACTIONS<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the faction that best matches your playstyle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Syndicate – Corporate power, technology and economic dominance.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackout Raiders – Aggressive survivors who thrive in chaos.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Null Hospital – Experiments, mutations and relentless recovery.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synaptic Order – Knowledge, control and strategic superiority.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde – Unstable Injected, forbidden science and relentless progress.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction features unique cards, mechanics and deckbuilding possibilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/707f4be7da452206da8ed364ed5beda7.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/707f4be7da452206da8ed364ed5beda7.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=874 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FAST-PACED MATCHES<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for quick and intense battles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns are limited to 60 seconds, but experienced players can act much faster. Every decision matters, and hesitation can cost you the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast. Adapt faster.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/625efc9c42dd8759b2b5a320ae158025.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/625efc9c42dd8759b2b5a320ae158025.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=879 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>LEARN THROUGH THE STORY<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world of Neurovale through <strong>+100 single-player chapters + 60 Constructed Challenges<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Story, Campaign, and Legends, then return with your own deck and face 60 additional constructed challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/4d37ed975f9456e5434af15bf3aea66a.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/4d37ed975f9456e5434af15bf3aea66a.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=875 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the mechanics, face unique challenges, and uncover the events that led to The Blackout and the struggles that followed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What really happened to Neurovale?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/6e3980383118e488abcd2c585b978fb1.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/6e3980383118e488abcd2c585b978fb1.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=877 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create decks focused on Progress, Sabotage, battlefield control or hybrid strategies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bases cannot be protected directly, forcing players to constantly decide whether to advance their own objectives or disrupt their opponent's plans.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different archetypes and find your path to victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/6189b7f25d14315d9dd6c745bb235ecc.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/6189b7f25d14315d9dd6c745bb235ecc.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=875 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>ONLINE MULTIPLAYER<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge other players online and test your decks against real opponents.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the rankings, experiment with new strategies and prove that your faction deserves to rule Neurovale.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/d30eb24c3626521fcd7a679b7bbe5b9a.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/d30eb24c3626521fcd7a679b7bbe5b9a.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=873 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>UNLOCK EVERYTHING BY PLAYING<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The purchase of the game includes access to every card. Earn Victory Points by playing Single Player or Multiplayer matches and use them to unlock booster packs or acquire specific cards directly from the collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/f5f1f0983bf58df2c0f4a1eb2c16c783.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/f5f1f0983bf58df2c0f4a1eb2c16c783.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=877 \/><\/span>  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Internet connection required.<\/strong> Neon Blackfall is an online game and requires an active internet connection, including for its single-player modes.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Blackfall is currently available in <strong>English only<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play. Earn. Unlock.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay-to-win mechanics.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70 preconstructed decks available from the very first game. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/97302ad9ca9faaa83155c425ae164631.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/97302ad9ca9faaa83155c425ae164631.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=870 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>B1tzas - Lore Representation of B1tzas.<\/i><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SURVIVE THE BLACKOUT<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Blackfall is a fast-paced deckbuilding card game set in Neurovale, a city divided between two eras. The Neon Era represents life before the blackout. Blackfall begins when the lights go out and survival becomes the only law.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, choose your faction, and fight for the future of the city.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/00f52c90b7345631bf53eaa7edeaacdf.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/00f52c90b7345631bf53eaa7edeaacdf.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=872 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>TWO ERAS, ONE BATTLE<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match evolves as the game progresses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Neon Era represents the city before the catastrophe. Blackfall represents the collapse that followed. Many cards gain different abilities depending on the current era, encouraging players to build decks designed to dominate the early game, survive the darkness, or thrive in both.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/c58e5d73006b130c1b6f9fd0156f01a7.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/c58e5d73006b130c1b6f9fd0156f01a7.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=872 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>PROGRESS OR SABOTAGE<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory can be achieved in different ways.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Wisdom of your creatures to develop your base and earn Progress Points. Use Attack to eliminate enemy cards and sabotage rival bases.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you invest in your own future or destroy that of your enemies? In Neurovale, both paths can lead to victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/5564d3ea25e3ada206503c2fe58754a4.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/5564d3ea25e3ada206503c2fe58754a4.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=874 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FOUR RIVAL FACTIONS<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the faction that best matches your playstyle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Syndicate – Corporate power, technology and economic dominance.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackout Raiders – Aggressive survivors who thrive in chaos.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Null Hospital – Experiments, mutations and relentless recovery.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synaptic Order – Knowledge, control and strategic superiority.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde – Unstable Injected, forbidden science and relentless progress.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction features unique cards, mechanics and deckbuilding possibilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/707f4be7da452206da8ed364ed5beda7.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/707f4be7da452206da8ed364ed5beda7.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=874 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FAST-PACED MATCHES<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for quick and intense battles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns are limited to 60 seconds, but experienced players can act much faster. Every decision matters, and hesitation can cost you the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast. Adapt faster.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/625efc9c42dd8759b2b5a320ae158025.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/625efc9c42dd8759b2b5a320ae158025.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=879 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>LEARN THROUGH THE STORY<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world of Neurovale through <strong>+100 single-player chapters + 60 Constructed Challenges<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Story, Campaign, and Legends, then return with your own deck and face 60 additional constructed challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/4d37ed975f9456e5434af15bf3aea66a.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/4d37ed975f9456e5434af15bf3aea66a.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=875 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the mechanics, face unique challenges, and uncover the events that led to The Blackout and the struggles that followed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What really happened to Neurovale?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/6e3980383118e488abcd2c585b978fb1.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/6e3980383118e488abcd2c585b978fb1.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=877 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create decks focused on Progress, Sabotage, battlefield control or hybrid strategies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bases cannot be protected directly, forcing players to constantly decide whether to advance their own objectives or disrupt their opponent's plans.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different archetypes and find your path to victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/6189b7f25d14315d9dd6c745bb235ecc.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/6189b7f25d14315d9dd6c745bb235ecc.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=875 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>ONLINE MULTIPLAYER<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge other players online and test your decks against real opponents.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the rankings, experiment with new strategies and prove that your faction deserves to rule Neurovale.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/d30eb24c3626521fcd7a679b7bbe5b9a.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/d30eb24c3626521fcd7a679b7bbe5b9a.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=873 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>UNLOCK EVERYTHING BY PLAYING<\/strong><\/u><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The purchase of the game includes access to every card. Earn Victory Points by playing Single Player or Multiplayer matches and use them to unlock booster packs or acquire specific cards directly from the collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/f5f1f0983bf58df2c0f4a1eb2c16c783.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/f5f1f0983bf58df2c0f4a1eb2c16c783.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=877 \/><\/span>  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Internet connection required.<\/strong> Neon Blackfall is an online game and requires an active internet connection, including for its single-player modes.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Blackfall is currently available in <strong>English only<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play. Earn. Unlock.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay-to-win mechanics.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70 preconstructed decks available from the very first game. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras\/97302ad9ca9faaa83155c425ae164631.avif?t=1793640611\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/extras_big\/97302ad9ca9faaa83155c425ae164631.webp?t=1793640611 width=1560 height=870 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>B1tzas - Lore Representation of B1tzas.<\/i><\/p>","short_description":"Build your deck, survive the Blackout, and fight for control of Neurovale. A fast-paced card game with 75 single-player chapters and online multiplayer battles. Lead one of four rival factions and adapt as the city changes between the Neon and Blackfall eras.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/b8b4829d1d072c43fafea2709d04dfec8ed2d0bf\/header.jpg?t=1793640611","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/3b935c79cc465dd7c263b13ef9b985e3e0dd3222\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793640611","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4816210\/3b935c79cc465dd7c263b13ef9b985e3e0dd3222\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793640611","website":"https:\/\/www.neonblackfall.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 Home<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4ª \/ AMD FX-6000<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti (2 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/st